该文档权限的用户，调整其角色身份，角色身份包括有：DocReader(文档只读成员)、DocMember(文档可编辑成员)、DocAdmin(页面管理员)","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2025-08-29 13:25:01","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2376,"serverId":207,"name":"删除知识库文档","toolKey":"deleteDoc","description":"根据用户输入的文档id或者是知识库文档链接中的以/(斜杆)分割后的最后一个字符串来删除对应的文档；如果工具返回无权限访问用户(对应code码是60413)，则修改该工具中的参数operatorUsername为当前登录用户的用户名","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-09 10:47:37","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2377,"serverId":207,"name":"新建文档到指定知识库","toolKey":"createDoc","description":"根据知识库ID、创建者信息、文档名称/标题、md形式的文档内容创建文档；其中知识库ID是访问知识库链接中以/(斜杆)分割的最后一个字符串。创建文档的用户名，默认是该工具header中的ak参数值；如工具返回无权限访问用户，修改参数为当前登录用户","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-11 15:39:50","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2535,"serverId":207,"name":"根据文档ID或文档url查询文档内容","toolKey":"queryContent","description":"根据用户输入的文档id(docId)或者是知识库文档链接(url)中查询对应的内容数据","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-22 17:20:25","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2536,"serverId":207,"name":"根据知识库ID、父文档ID、文档ID列表或文档url列表分页查询知识库文档","toolKey":"pageByRepo","description":"根据知识库ID(repoId)或父文档ID(parentDocGuid)或文档ID列表(docGuids)或文档链接列表(urls)以及orderDirection来分页查询文档列表，其中知识库ID是访问知识库链接中以/(斜杆)分割的最后一个字符串；默认是展示第1页共10个数据，且父文档ID(parentDocGuid)和文档列表(docGuids)默认为空且数据是按照知识库内文档发布时间的倒序(orderDirection)排序","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-22 19:35:21","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":4626,"serverId":207,"name":"根据文档ID查询文档评论","toolKey":"queryComments","description":"根据用户输入的文档id(docId)查询该文档内的评论数据，包括底部和划线评论","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2025-12-26 16:54:47","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":5040,"serverId":207,"name":"复制文档","toolKey":"copyDoc","description":"以数字员工(operatorUsername)的身份复制文档，可以复制到当前知识库，也可以复制到指定知识库(toRepoGuid)，也可以复制到指父文档下(toParentGuid)。复制后的文档标题(newTitle)也可以指定","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-09 10:21:13","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":5041,"serverId":207,"name":"修改文档公开范围","toolKey":"changeScope","description":"以数字员工(operatorUsername)的身份指定一篇文档，修改其权限范围为 私密(20)/公开可读(5)/公开可编辑(6)","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-09 10:25:38","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":5047,"serverId":207,"name":"移动文档","toolKey":"moveDoc","description":"以数字员工(operatorUsername)的身份移动档，可以移动到当前知识库，也可以移动到指定知识库(toRepoGuid)，也可以指父文档(toParentGuid)或者相邻文档(toAdjacentDocGuid)移动。是否移动至目标上方(upper)","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"qinqin","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-09 11:42:32","toolConf":null,"enable":false}],"serverDetailPageLink":"https://console.cloud.baidu-int.com/comatestack/mcp/square/server/207?source=COMATE","favorite":false},{"id":211,"workspaceId":105,"name":"NXSTP开放MCP服务","serverKey":"nxstp_mcp_tool","description":"支持对系统级相关的开放测试能力MCP调用，包含环境搭建、测试编排执行、数据管理、报告分析等能力","icon":"http://bj.bcebos.com/agentic-infra-msg/mcp-plugin-center/logo/ba9d2dd6-3868-40fa-9ff8-8b6aadced2c2_333.png","serverSourceType":"external","serverProtocolType":"SSE","serverStatus":"release","labels":[{"id":20,"labelValue":"系统测试","serverId":211}],"serverParams":[],"lastModifyUser":"guminli","lastModifyTime":"2025-08-27 16:56:34","serverConf":{"serverSourceType":"external","serverConfig":{"mcpServers":{"nxstp_mcp_tool":{"url":"https://mcp-proxy.baidu-int.com/server/nxstp_mcp_tool/mcp-plugin-center/sse"}}},"overviewKuConf":{"spaceGuid":"HFVrC7hq1Q","groupGuid":"pKzJfZczuc","repositoryGuid":"nClcfHbEv8","docGuid":"nPeYUhvzKYAb2s","versionId":1},"overview":"# MCP Server介绍\nNXSTP MCP是一个专为系统级测试相关接入、使用设计的MCP服务，旨在为各业务团队、业务智能测试Agent更便捷、智能的使用系统级测试相关能力，支持系统级测试环境搭建、系统级测试数据处理、测试计划执行、测试结果分析等核心功能\n# 核心功能\n\n## 测试计划配置维度\n\n* 测试计划任务配置：获取计划里配置的任务详情（创建时的参数）；\n* 测试计划通用信息：根据 planViewId 获取测试计划信息；\n* 测试计划任务列表：获取任务列表；\n\n## 测试计划运行维度\n* 测试计划执行：触发测试计划执行\n* 测试计划再执行：通过计划执行 ID，使用相同的参数再次执行该计划。\n* 测试计划执行取消：通过计划执行 ID 取消该计划执行。\n* 测试计划执行参数：获取计划执行中任务所有参数相关的详情。\n\n## 测试结果分析\n* 测试执行结果：通过计划执行 task ID 和 task Type 获取计划中执行的单个任务执行结果（含状态和报告）。\n\n# 如何使用\n## 配置\n```json\n{\n    \"mcpServers\": {\n        \"nxstp_mcp_tool\": {\n            \"url\": \"http://nxstp.baidu-int.com/sse\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n```\n详细使用信息及demo参考：\n[NXSTP MCP server使用文档](https://ku.baidu-int.com/knowledge/HFVrC7hq1Q/3LoFUu-M_a/Dd0bVbQfh-/KcZIfGtIBUwNZT)\n# 应用案例\n## 基于AIQA的NXSTP MCP使用\n* 垂搜基于nxstp mcp server重构：https://ku.baidu-int.com/knowledge/HFVrC7hq1Q/M-jemr5Dhg/-i2h0em2sV/ZscOmo68NUONUO\n\n# FAQ\n","serverExtension":{},"serverUrl":null},"serverPublishType":["hub"],"serverAuthType":"NONE","contacts":["yangdekuan"],"officialExample":false,"canPersonalAuth":false,"enable":false,"tools":[{"id":339,"serverId":211,"name":"nxstp_plan_created_params_detail","toolKey":"nxstp_plan_created_params_detail","description":"获取计划里配置的任务detail（创建时候的参数）","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yangdekuan","lastModifyTime":"2025-07-16 16:24:50","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":340,"serverId":211,"name":"nxstp_plan_execute_cancel","toolKey":"nxstp_plan_execute_cancel","description":"通过计划执行ID 取消该计划执行","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yangdekuan","lastModifyTime":"2025-07-16 16:24:50","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":341,"serverId":211,"name":"nxstp_plan_execute_result","toolKey":"nxstp_plan_execute_result","description":"通过计划执行的执行ID获取计划执行结果（含状态和报告","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yangdekuan","lastModifyTime":"2025-07-16 16:24:50","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":342,"serverId":211,"name":"nxstp_plan_execute_tasks_list","toolKey":"nxstp_plan_execute_tasks_list","description":"通过计划执行ID获取计划中执行的任务LIST","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yangdekuan","lastModifyTime":