yumengshan","lastModifyTime":"2025-12-03 17:22:02","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":4033,"serverId":687,"name":"show_all_databases","toolKey":"show_all_databases","description":"Get ALL tables in a database.","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yumengshan","lastModifyTime":"2025-12-03 17:22:02","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":4034,"serverId":687,"name":"table_overview","toolKey":"table_overview","description":"Get an overview of a specific table: columns, sample rows (up to 3).","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yumengshan","lastModifyTime":"2025-12-03 17:22:02","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":4035,"serverId":687,"name":"write_query","toolKey":"write_query","description":"Execute an DDL/DML or other Baikaldb command that do not have a ResultSet","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yumengshan","lastModifyTime":"2025-12-03 17:22:02","toolConf":null,"enable":false}],"serverDetailPageLink":"https://console.cloud.baidu-int.com/comatestack/mcp/square/server/687?source=COMATE","favorite":false},{"id":791,"workspaceId":106,"name":"aiScan-代码扫描","serverKey":"aiScan","description":"aiScan-mcp 代码扫描工具使用帮助：\n1. 代码扫描工具：使用 codeStyleCheck 工具触发代码扫描任务\n2. 查看最近一次本地扫描结果：使用 iscanResult 工具查看最近一次本地扫描结果，并获取修复建议\n3. 查询iCode代码扫描结果：使用 checkResultById 工具通过 jobId 查询 iCode 代码规范扫描结果\n4. Agent 配置方请参考知识库文档：https://ku.baidu-int.com/knowledge/HFVrC7hq1Q/pKzJfZczuc/nClcfHbEv8/lpF8HSFxIgvw_N","icon":"http://bj.bcebos.com/agentic-infra-msg/mcp-plugin-center/logo/dbf5fa00-08e7-404e-a302-f8e391167b06_infoflow 2025-10-27 19-50-21.png","serverSourceType":"external","serverProtocolType":"STDIO","serverStatus":"release","labels":[{"id":16,"labelValue":"研发编码","serverId":791}],"serverParams":[],"lastModifyUser":"yufengchao","lastModifyTime":"2025-11-24 11:43:32","serverConf":{"serverSourceType":"external","serverConfig":{"mcpServers":{"aiScan":{"timeout":720,"command":"npx","args":["-y","--registry","http://registry.npm.baidu-int.com","@baidu/aiscan-mcp-online"]}}},"overviewKuConf":{"spaceGuid":"HFVrC7hq1Q","groupGuid":"pKzJfZczuc","repositoryGuid":"nClcfHbEv8","docGuid":"lpF8HSFxIgvw_N","versionId":26},"overview":"aiScan-代码扫描介绍\n\n## 一、背景\n随着大模型技术推动代码的快速生成，软件开发进入了前所未有的高效率时代，在高速编写的同步周期内，建立与之匹配的自动化、高精度代码质量监控与修复能力，以保障产出的可靠性与安全性，防止效率提升带来的技术风险失控。\n\n###### Agent配置方式\n1、通过MCP市场，安装aiScan-代码扫描插件，查看插件安装状态，显示绿色表示已安装完成，并且可以执行（暂时需要安装Nodejs环境，推荐Nodejs-20+）\n\n![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=d6e74f81258f4e12bc00ae27ed26dfcb&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")\n![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=01a3fa18c14e43f2b3ff8356f8b360ca&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")\n![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=d3393790947144d3b9b7b399fbf407a7&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")\n搜索不到的情况下，使用直接将下面的mcp.json文件，粘贴到./comate目录下\n\n```\n{\n    \"mcpServers\": {    \n        \"aiScan\": {\n            \"protocolType\": \"STDIO\",\n            \"timeout\": 180,\n            \"command\": \"npx\",\n            \"args\": [\n                \"-y\",\n                \"--registry\",\n                \"http://registry.npm.baidu-int.com\",\n                \"@baidu/aiscan-mcp-online\"\n            ]\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n2、配置Agent 入口：通过Comate-Chat 对话栏，添加Agent\n\n![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=e50d516b449e42c5925e511dce5d4b08&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")\n3、配置字段：\n\n|图示|字段|输入信息|\n|-|-|-|\n|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=ad75903b9b3e4f15855e58c936b6aecd&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")|名称|代码扫描|\n||描述|进行代码扫描、规范、缺陷扫描并修复问题，查看历史或iCode扫描结果|\n||执行策略|Default（推荐）|\n||指令|你是代码安全与质量专家，请将我提供的代码片段或项目路径进行扫描，识别潜在代码缺陷与不规范写法，并提供修复建议。扫描需覆盖：性能问题、代码规范、代码缺陷、依赖项检查等。报告需专业清晰，定位准确，修复方案具体可行并且准确，不要猜测或编造。|\n||MCP Server|勾选aiScan|\n\n### \n## 二、能力与配置方式\n###### 2.1 工具能力介绍\n1. 代码扫描工具（excute_by_aiscan）：IDE本地直接触发代码扫描任务\n\n|常用query|结果截图|备注|\n|-|-|-|\n|代码扫描|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=71c91eefa1d249fb907e2f61ab28de4d&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n|规范扫描|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=26f98c9bb75a477f9e1ecd438d585e3e&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n||||\n\n2. 查看最近一次本地扫描结果（ search_report_byRecent_from_aiscan ）：使用工具查看最近一次本地扫描结果，并获取修复建议\n\n|常用query|结果截图|备注|\n|-|-|-|\n|最近一次扫描|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=fd9fb3b4006045a0aeeeca3db28aab6b&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n|最近一次扫描结果|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=f2964dc45e5c404ab22a1dddfd87c249&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n\n3. 查询iCode代码扫描结果（search_report_byId_from_icode）：通过 jobId 查询 iCode 代码规范扫描结果\n\n|iCode|使用示意图|\n|-|-|\n|![点击跳转](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=c9712eb6a95145f1a673004981dd6970&docGuid=6BMyuwNclmgun5 \"点击跳转\")  ![获取ID，去IDE](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=528de11a03a547b98e3a30db0162714e&docGuid=6BMyuwNclmgun5 \"获取ID，去IDE\")|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=d35bce3c0ee94bb1836a82012a66bd1c&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")|\n\n|常用query|结果截图|备注|\n|-|-|-|\n|icode扫描问题修复 + id|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=ee4a2a6c5174454788d57951f2761fa0&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n|icode扫描结果+id|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=cc67452f9e2f4b21aa74ab345de7d482&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n|icode扫描结果修复|![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=61de3ea7990e4e2ba2fbd98d136c92df&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")||\n\n## 二、常见问题FAQ\n**1、MCP市场搜索异常，搜索不到aiScan代码扫描，可手动将内容，粘贴到mcp.json文件下**\n\n```\n{\n    \"mcpServers\": {    \n        \"aiScan\": {\n            \"protocolType\": \"STDIO\",\n            \"timeout\": 180,\n            \"command\": \"npx\",\n            \"args\": [\n                \"-y\",\n                \"--registry\",\n                \"http://registry.npm.baidu-int.com\",\n                \"@baidu/aiscan-mcp-online\"\n            ]\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n**2、配置mcp.json后，刷新工具，报错****未找到命令\"npx\" ****或添加时****提示需要安装node环境 ,****参考官方文档步骤安装环境**[https://nodejs.org/en/download](https://nodejs.org/en/download)****\n\n![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=1336f3eefeac47a4b0124b7bd6f53641&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")\n**3、「代码扫描」对话后，未执行代码扫描工具，直接由模型输出，检查当前代码库是否已 安装aiScan ，或aiScan状态是否正常**\n\n![查看aiScan安装状态](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=07f907162a9c441ea6754a1de0aa97e0&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"查看aiScan安装状态\")\n![安装中或异常](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=e5572027d6884963a40f90391f3523d9&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"安装中或异常\")\n![已安装](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=1708210530c049b1ac8ec02da215c64b&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"已安装\")\n![状态异常，需检查mcp.json后重新刷新](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=dd34bf18dd4f4b6e81b0726a65892f52&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"状态异常，需检查mcp.json后重新刷新\")\n**4、扫描路径异常，提示****f****atal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git，****请检查是否在项目根路径打开**\n\n![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=7aeb34907ebf4d58822caeb2987ef7b1&docGuid=lpF8HSFxIgvw_N \"\")\n\n\n## 三、运营与反馈\n联系人：wangjie66\n\n体验与反馈群：11479582\n\n反馈建议收集：11479582\n\n","serverExtension":{},"serverUrl":null},"serverPublishType":["hub"],"serverAuthType":"NONE","contacts":["yufengchao"],"officialExample":false,"canPersonalAuth":false,"enable":false,"tools":[{"id":2656,"serverId":791,"name":"excute_by_aiscan","toolKey":"excute_by_aiscan","description":"触发代码扫描任务,检测代码规范和缺陷问题,支持JAVA和PYTHON文件扫描,并生成修复建议,执行前请同步用户\"扫码任务执行时间5min左右，请耐心等待\"","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yufengchao","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-28 15:40:19","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2657,"serverId":791,"name":"help","toolKey":"help","description":"获取 aiScan 代码扫描工具的使用帮助","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yufengchao","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-28 15:40:19","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2658,"serverId":791,"name":"search_report_byId_from_icode","toolKey":"search_report_byId_from_icode","description":"查询iCode代码规范扫描结果","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yufengchao","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-28 15:40:19","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":2659,"serverId":791,"name":"search_report_byRecent_from_aiscan","toolKey":"search_report_byRecent_from_aiscan","description":"查看最近一次本地扫描结果并修复","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yufengchao","lastModifyTime":"2025-10-28 15:40:19","toolConf":null,"enable":false}],"serverDetailPageLink":"https://console.cloud.baidu-int.com/comatestack/mcp/square/server/791?source=COMATE","favorite":false},{"id":803,"workspaceId":271,"name":"Noah日志查询分析","serverKey":"logmine","description":"实例级日志抓取、日志查询及分析","icon":"http://bj.bcebos.com/agentic-infra-msg/mcp-plugin-center/logo/44b61844-5d25-4b49-b7b5-c1c66bfa5184_日志分析.png","serverSourceType":"external","serverProtocolType":"SSE","serverStatus":"release","labels":[{"id":72,"labelValue":"日志分析","serverId":803}],"serverParams":[],"lastModifyUser":"yinqichen","lastModifyTime":"2025-12-15 11:20:41","serverConf":{"serverSourceType":"external","serverConfig":{"mcpServers":{"logmine":{"timeout":30,"url":"https://mcp-proxy.baidu-int.com/server/logmine/mcp-plugin-center/sse"}}},"overviewKuConf":{"spaceGuid":"HFVrC7hq1Q","groupGuid":"pKzJfZczuc","repositoryGuid":"nClcfHbEv8","docGuid":"tUu0sFThRe4klc","versionId":12},"overview":"Noah日志查询分析\n\n## MCP Server介绍\n### ✨应用场景\n提供三种场景下的实例级日志抓取、日志查询及分析能力\n\n### 😊目标用户\n需要查看并分析实例日志的研发团队、个人等\n\n### 🔍使用场合\n1. 报警id抓取：在Noah 3.0报警场景下，需要查看并分析实例日志\n2. 日志指标抓取：想要针对某日志指标、某实例进行日志抓取\n3. 日志路径抓取：想要针对某实例、某路径的日志进行日志抓取\n4. 想要对日志原文进行查询和分析（开发中）\n\n## 前置条件\n1、如果是通过报警id抓取，该报警指标需要为日志指标，且报警时段的日志文件存在。（如果日志滚动速度过快，文件不存在则无法抓取）\n\n2、如果是指标抓取，需要是日志指标，且抓取时段的日志文件存在\n\n3、如果是路径抓取，该路径对应的日志文件需要配置过监控日志采集任务，并能正常产出日志指标；此外，抓取时段的日志文件存在\n\n### 📝鉴权方式\n无需鉴权\n\n## 核心功能\n当前已提供如下工具：\n\n1. crawl_log_by_alert - 根据告警ID进行日志抓取\n2. crawl_log_by_metric - 根据日志指标进行异常维度聚类分析\n3. crawl_log_by_path - 根据日志路径进行异常机房范围分析\n\n## 经典案例：\n|Query|工具|工具描述|截图|\n|-|-|-|-|\n|抓取报警17627368804655880的实例日志 |crawl_log_by_alert|根据告警ID进行日志抓取| ![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=2931b7c5b8e149d9b0788c23c56ab305&docGuid=tUu0sFThRe4klc \"\") ![](https://rte.weiyun.baidu.com/wiki/attach/image/api/imageDownloadAddress?attachId=02492ee19b024762a11cfc30183658c3&docGuid=tUu0sFThRe4klc \"\")|","serverExtension":{},"serverUrl":null},"serverPublishType":["hub"],"serverAuthType":"NONE","contacts":["yinqichen"],"officialExample":false,"canPersonalAuth":false,"enable":false,"tools":[{"id":5027,"serverId":803,"name":"crawl_log_by_alert","toolKey":"crawl_log_by_alert","description":"提供Noah（监控3.0）监控系统的报警ID（pkgID），抓取异常日志，展示报警相关的前20行日志","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yinqichen","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-08 15:31:25","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":5028,"serverId":803,"name":"crawl_log_by_metric","toolKey":"crawl_log_by_metric","description":"根据Noah（监控3.0）监控系统的监控指标、监控实例名和时间范围来抓取日志，展示报警相关的前20行日志","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yinqichen","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-08 15:31:25","toolConf":null,"enable":false},{"id":5029,"serverId":803,"name":"crawl_log_by_path","toolKey":"crawl_log_by_path","description":"根据Noah（监控3.0）监控系统的日志文件路径、监控实例名和时间范围来抓取日志，展示报警相关的前20行日志","toolStatus":"complete","toolParams":null,"lastModifyUser":"yinqichen","lastModifyTime":"2026-01-08 15:31:25","toolConf":null,"enable":fals